# Charging on the docking station (hw/charge). on = false stops charging at once, e.g. before the mower leaves the
# station, and keeps it off until on = true or the contact ends. on = true allows it again; where the driver charges by
# itself (host_charge_control false) it starts again while the mower has contact.
# A driver without charge_stop in hw/capabilities cannot do either and answers success = false.
bool on
---
bool success
string message
